Unsigned 32-bit quotient and remainder, preserving mp_div on nonzero divisors. Unlike the source MP_VAL error, divisor zero returns quotient 0xffffffff and the original dividend as remainder. Packed ready/valid records and reset are BEHAVE adaptations; no cycle correspondence to the C implementation is claimed.

